# Buruuj Fintech is the platform owner

Buruuj Fintech Ltd owns and operates this Tawarruq engine. It is the operator, not a bank or SACCO tenant.

- Do not add Buruuj Fintech as an institution in the Institutions list, Integrations dropdown, or seed data.
- Institutions are client banks that Buruuj serves (for example Default Institution, Demo Islamic Bank, FlowOps Africa).
- Integrations, users, and deals belong to those client institutions. Buruuj executes as agent and issues certificates.
- In copy and process diagrams, Buruuj is the engine / wakeel. The bank owns the customer relationship.
